    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">大部分内容可参考如何读论文的思考逻辑去进行整理和汇报</span><span class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\"><span data-rect-container=\"true\"><span data-zero-space=\"true\">​</span><span data-fake-text=\" \" contenteditable=\"false\" selectionapi=\"[object Object]\" class=\"mention-doc-embed-container\"><a class=\"mention-doc mention-doc-permission-fg contextmenu-without-copyperm\" target=\"_self\" href=\"https://dy8q0bnq8y.feishu.cn/wiki/Jwi3wswLNitezskeCOQcqT1rnSe\" data-href=\"https://dy8q0bnq8y.feishu.cn/wiki/Jwi3wswLNitezskeCOQcqT1rnSe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-component-id=\"4c0371c2-87b0-4814-ab76-8b1c5fcee499\" data-token=\"Jwi3wswLNitezskeCOQcqT1rnSe\" data-icon-info=\"null\"><span class=\"embed-inline-link embed-inline-link--disable embed-inline-link--hoverable\"><span><span class=\"custom-icon custom-icon__icon-image gpf-biz-suite-custom-icon__icon-wrapper\">​<img class=\"gpf-biz-suite-custom-icon__icon-image\" src=\"https://sf1-scmcdn-cn.feishucdn.com/obj/lark-reaction-cn/green_cloud.png\"></span><span class=\"text embed-text-container\">如何找论文、读论文</span></span></span></a></span></span></span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "3": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">其他需要注意的几个地方：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "4": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">学术汇报的形式</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading1"
  },
  "5": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">学术汇报PPT不需要炫酷的动画，但要做到基本的美观</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">，比如：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "6": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">中英文字体设置合理、是否统一，例如中文可以用雅黑、幼圆，英文可以用Calibri、Times New Roman等</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "7": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">字号、行间距设置合理，一般</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-yellow-dark-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">标题字号在32~36之间，正文字号在18~24之间，行间距在1.2-1.5之间</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "8": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">每页PPT不要出现大段的文字</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">，每部分文字应该少于3行，除非重要引用，讲PPT的时候不要逐字读文字</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "9": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">重要的部分可以添加高亮颜色、底色框吸引听众注意力</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "10": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">设置关键的目录页、导航页来分解、吸引听众注意力</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "11": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">有一些图片可以让AI来生成，但是要确保内容和逻辑是正确的</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "12": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">更多制作PPT的基本技巧可参考斯坦福的这个报告：</span><span class=\"outer-u-container docx-outer-link-container\" data-inline-wrapper=\"true\"><span class=\" author-7076000738450669572 link-wrapper link-text-color link-start link-end link-id-12-0-1\" data-leaf=\"true\"><a style=\"cursor:pointer;text-decoration-skip:none;\" class=\"link contextmenu-without-copyperm\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WF411Y73C/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=4deb09ae020d1de21482612e7102fb83\" data-href=\"https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bilibili.com%2Fvideo%2FBV1WF411Y73C%2F%3Fspm_id_from%3D333.337.search-card.all.click%26vd_source%3D4deb09ae020d1de21482612e7102fb83\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-node=\"true\"><span data-string=\"true\">如何做好学术报告</span></a></span></span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "13": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">学术汇报的内容</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "14": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">论文汇报应当选择比较高质量的文章</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">。AI领域论文非常多，但是很多论文都很水，需要自己做一些价值判断，比如你有没有从这篇文章中学到一些新东西？你分享这篇文章希望大家从这篇文章中学到什么？你后续是否打算follow这篇文章继续往下做？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "15": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">也可以做一个方向的Tutorial</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">，比如最近出现了一个与我们研究方向相关、比较火热的词，可以介绍一下相关的工作与发展脉络。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "16": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">汇报的时候要多站在听众的角度考虑问题，学会换位思考</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">。尤其是组会的论文分享，要做到讲的内容能让80%以上的人听懂，因此，需要根据受众的范围、知识水平，来决定是否需要添加额外的前置知识。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "17": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">对于大部分论文，可以参考如下思考：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "18": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-green-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">针对总体贡献</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "19": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">能否用2-3句话总结这篇文章做了什么事情？例如，针对xxx问题，提出了xxx方法，在xxx任务上取得了xxx性能。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "20": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-green-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">对于论文动机：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "21": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">这篇文章想解决什么问题？是在做一个很多人研究的问题，还是提出了一个新问题？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "22": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">如果是很多人研究过的问题，目前相关的工作有哪些？相关工作可以分成哪几类？本文工作和已有工作相比，核心的优势、创新点是什么？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "23": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">如果是一个新问题，那么这个问题是否是真实存在的，还是作者臆想的？什么场景会遇到该问题？解决了这个问题能带来什么好处？有没有简单的方法可以解决这个问题？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "24": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-green-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">针对论文方法：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "25": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">本文所提方法的主要流程是什么，例如，从算法的输入到输出经过了几个步骤？系统是怎么运行的？包括哪几个模块？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "26": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">为什么xxx模块是必须的？为什么xxx技术是可行的？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "27": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">每一个模块、技术对于作者想要解决的问题有什么作用？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "28": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">在什么场景下该方法适用？什么场景下不适用？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "29": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">还有哪些没有做好的地方，如果是你想进一步优化这个方法，你会怎么做？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "30": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-green-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">针对论文实验：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "31": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">为什么选择这些数据集、对比方法？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "32": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">实验设置是否合理、对比是否公平？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "33": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">实验结论是否与作者的motivation一致？是否挂羊头卖狗肉？作者claim要解决的问题，有没有解决？结果是否显著?</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "34": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 text-highlight-background text-highlight-background-green-light-bg\" data-leaf=\"true\">尝试总结与思考：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "35": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">把自己当做这篇文章的审稿人，能否给出这篇文章的3个优点和缺点？对于做的不好的地方，你希望作者如何改进，应该做到什么程度？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "36": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">你从这篇文章中学到了什么令你感觉新奇的事情？哪怕是论文写作、绘图配色的技巧也很好。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "37": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">这篇论文要解决的问题，如果交给你来做，你会怎么做？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "38": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">与这篇论文相关的、您觉得值得研究的一个后续想法是什么？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "39": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
